<title>FINLAND: FINVEST SEES BETTER 1997 EARNINGS.</title>
<headline>FINVEST SEES BETTER 1997 EARNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish consulting and capacitor group Finvest Oy said on Tuesday it expects its consolidated earnings to improve significantly in 1997 on 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;I expect the consolidated earnings to improve significantly during the current year,&quot; Finvest said in a statement quoting president and CEO Niilo Pellonmaa.</p>
<p>Finvest said earlier its 1996 profit after financial items was 13.0 million markka, down from 81.7 million.  </p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
